   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: AVP 2022- Expenditure Verification and Systems Audit ECOFISH PE LVFO &amp; PE IOC and INCA grant  - The overall objective of the EOFISH programme is to enhance equitable economic growth by promoting sustainable fisheries in the EA-SA-IO region. The specific objective is to support sustainable management and development of fisheries, while addressing climate change resilience and enhancing marine biodiversity</narrative>
